#. Plugin name — proper noun, normally left untranslated.
#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:191
#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:192
#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:252
msgid "YK Grid Variations"
msgstr "YK Grid Variations"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:253
msgid ""
"Controls what is displayed on WooCommerce category, archive, and "
"single product pages."
msgstr ""
"Steuert, was auf WooCommerce-Kategorie-, Archiv- und "
"Einzelproduktseiten angezeigt wird."

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:258
msgid "Product Cards"
msgstr "Produktkarten"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:259
msgid "Applies to archive and category pages."
msgstr "Gilt für Archiv- und Kategorieseiten."

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:264
msgid "Sale badge"
msgstr "SALE-Badge"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:269
msgid "Show SALE badge on discounted products"
msgstr "SALE-Badge bei reduzierten Produkten anzeigen"

#. Settings row label for the product item number.
#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:275
msgid "SKU"
msgstr "Art.-Nr."

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:280
msgid "Display item number / SKU beneath the product title"
msgstr "Art.-Nr. / SKU unter dem Produkttitel anzeigen"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:286
msgid "Variation swatches &amp; pills"
msgstr "Varianten-Swatches &amp; Pills"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:291
msgid "Show variation swatches and pills on category pages"
msgstr "Varianten-Swatches und Pills auf Kategorieseiten anzeigen"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:294
msgid ""
"Every attribute marked \"Used for variations\" on the product is shown "
"automatically, in the order set there."
msgstr ""
"Jedes Attribut, das beim Produkt als „Für Varianten verwendet“ "
"markiert ist, wird automatisch angezeigt – in der dort festgelegten "
"Reihenfolge."

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:300
msgid "Quantity stepper"
msgstr "Mengen-Stepper"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:305
msgid "Show +/− quantity stepper on product cards"
msgstr "+/− Mengen-Stepper auf Produktkarten anzeigen"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:312
msgid "Archive paging"
msgstr "Archiv-Seitennavigation"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:314
msgid ""
"Individual categories can override this on their own edit screen "
"(Products → Categories)."
msgstr ""
"Einzelne Kategorien können dies auf ihrer eigenen Bearbeitungsseite "
"überschreiben (Produkte → Kategorien)."

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:320
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Modus"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:324
msgid "Pagination (WooCommerce links)"
msgstr "Seitennummerierung (WooCommerce-Links)"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:334
msgid "Prefetch distance"
msgstr "Vorlade-Distanz"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:340
msgid ""
"How far before the end of the list the next page starts loading. "
"Raise it on slower servers so shoppers never see a spinner."
msgstr ""
"Wie weit vor dem Ende der Liste die nächste Seite zu laden beginnt. "
"Auf langsameren Servern erhöhen, damit Kundinnen und Kunden nie "
"einen Spinner sehen."

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:347
msgid "Theme style variation"
msgstr "Theme-Stilvariante"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:349
msgid ""
"WordPress does not record which style variation is active, so it has "
"to be selected here. The choice only adds a body class — it does not "
"switch the variation itself."
msgstr ""
"WordPress speichert nirgends, welche Stilvariante aktiv ist – sie "
"muss deshalb hier ausgewählt werden. Die Auswahl fügt lediglich eine "
"Body-Klasse hinzu; sie wechselt die Variante nicht."

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:355
msgid "Active variation"
msgstr "Aktive Variante"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:359
msgid "The active theme ships no style variations."
msgstr "Das aktive Theme enthält keine Stilvarianten."

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:367
msgid "— None —"
msgstr "— Keine —"

#. translators: %s: generated CSS body class, e.g. yk-variant-shop-attack
#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:380
msgid ""
"Adds %s to the body element, so the plugin stylesheet can override "
"its --yk-* design tokens for this variation."
msgstr ""
"Fügt dem Body-Element %s hinzu, damit das Plugin-Stylesheet die "
"--yk-*-Design-Tokens für diese Variante überschreiben kann."

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:384
msgid ""
"Adds a body.yk-variant-* class so the plugin stylesheet can override "
"its --yk-* design tokens for this variation."
msgstr ""
"Fügt eine body.yk-variant-*-Klasse hinzu, damit das "
"Plugin-Stylesheet die --yk-*-Design-Tokens für diese Variante "
"überschreiben kann."

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:394
msgid "Single Product Page"
msgstr "Einzelproduktseite"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:399
msgid "Enhanced variation UI"
msgstr "Erweiterte Varianten-Oberfläche"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:404
msgid ""
"Replace variation dropdowns with swatches/pills and add +/− quantity "
"stepper"
msgstr ""
"Varianten-Dropdowns durch Swatches/Pills ersetzen und +/− "
"Mengen-Stepper hinzufügen"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-term-meta.php:105
msgid "Select swatch image"
msgstr "Swatch-Bild auswählen"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-term-meta.php:106
msgid "Use this image"
msgstr "Dieses Bild verwenden"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-term-meta.php:120
#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-term-meta.php:142
msgid "Swatch colour"
msgstr "Swatch-Farbe"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-term-meta.php:124
#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-term-meta.php:147
msgid "Swatch image"
msgstr "Swatch-Bild"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-term-meta.php:181
msgid "Primary colour"
msgstr "Primärfarbe"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-term-meta.php:188
msgid "Second colour (two-tone)"
msgstr "Zweite Farbe (zweifarbig)"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-term-meta.php:192
msgid "Single colour"
msgstr "Einfarbig"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-term-meta.php:200
msgid ""
"Single colour (#000000) or two-tone, comma separated "
"(#000000,#ffcc00). Leave empty to fall back to the built-in "
"colour-name map."
msgstr ""
"Einfarbig (#000000) oder zweifarbig, kommagetrennt "
"(#000000,#ffcc00). Leer lassen, um auf die integrierte "
"Farbnamen-Zuordnung zurückzufallen."

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-term-meta.php:224
msgid "Select image"
msgstr "Bild auswählen"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-term-meta.php:227
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "Entfernen"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-term-meta.php:231
msgid "An image takes precedence over the colour above."
msgstr "Ein Bild hat Vorrang vor der Farbe oben."

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-term-meta.php:316
msgid "Swatch"
msgstr "Swatch"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-term-meta.php:356
msgid "No swatch set"
msgstr "Kein Swatch gesetzt"

